            envelope. This extension method reads <c>usage</c> from the operation's final response and
            deserializes it into an <see cref="T:Azure.AI.ContentUnderstanding.AnalyzeUsageDetails" /> instance. The operation must have completed
            successfully before calling this method.
            </remarks>
